  preOpLines:
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: 'After being jolted awake from the sudden noise, you wake up and go to
      check on whats happened. you open the front door of your tavern and are faced
      with three adventures. Two adventurers carrying their injured comrade. '
  - speaker: Healthy Adventurer 1
    text: HELP! OUR FRIEND HERE IS HEAVILY INJURED! WE HEARD YOU HELP HEAL PEOPLE
      HERE.
  - speaker: Healthy Adventurer 2
    text: 'THE CHURCH IS CLOSED AT THIS HOUR AND THIS IS OUR LAST HOPE. '
  - speaker: Player
    text: 'Alright, let me bring him to the clinic we have here. '
  - speaker: Player
    text: I don't have my nurse with me right now, but I'll see what I can do to
      help patch him up.
  surgeryLines:
  - speaker: Player
    text: He's been losing a lot of blood on his way here, we should start with a
      water spell.
